<navigation-bar title="{{isEdit ? '编辑菜品' : '添加菜品'}}" back="{{true}}" color="#332b26" background="#f8f5f1"></navigation-bar>
<view class="page page-content">
  <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="error-text">{{errorMessage}}</view>
  <view class="form-card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">菜名</text>
      <input value="{{name}}" placeholder="例如：番茄炒蛋" maxlength="100" bindinput="onNameInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="label">分类</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{categoryOptions}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="onCategoryChange">
        <view class="picker-field">
          <text>{{category}}</text>
          <text class="picker-hint">选择分类</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="field last-field">
      <text class="label">备注</text>
      <textarea value="{{remark}}" placeholder="口味、食材或烹饪提示（可选）" maxlength="500" bindinput="onRemarkInput" />
      <text class="character-count">{{remark.length}}/500</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="form-actions">
    <button class="secondary-button" disabled="{{saving || deleting}}" bindtap="cancel">取消</button>
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || deleting}}" bindtap="save">保存菜品</button>
  </view>
  <button wx:if="{{isEdit}}" class="delete-dish-button" loading="{{deleting}}" disabled="{{saving || deleting}}" bindtap="remove">删除这道菜</button>
</view>
